  "title": "Summit Physical Therapy 2024 PBC Request and Partner Organizer — Intake",
  "path": "Engagements/Summit_Physical_Therapy/2024/Workpapers/Summit_PT_PBC_Request_Organizer.docx",
  "document": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "Summit Physical Therapy, LLC — 2024 Tax Return"
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Prepared-By-Client (PBC) Request and Partner Organizer"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Engagement: 2024 Form 1065 (Partnership Return) and related Schedules K-1 for the two members. This package initiates the intake per the engagement plan and ticket tkt-000009. Please return completed items to Lucia Mendes (lucia.mendes@firm.com) by Friday, February 28, 2025, or earlier if possible."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Entity-Level PBC Request"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "The following documents and data are needed from Summit Physical Therapy, LLC to prepare the 2024 partnership return:"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": true,
        "items": [
          "2024 general ledger trial balance (opening and closing balances, with detailed income and expense accounts) — Excel preferred",
          "2024 bank statements for all accounts (checking, savings, money market) — monthly statements for all twelve months",
          "2024 credit card statements for all business cards",
          "2024 loan statements (term notes, equipment financing, any lines of credit) and corresponding Form 1098, if any",
          "Fixed asset schedule: additions, dispositions, and accumulated depreciation for 2024",
          "2024 payroll summaries and Forms 941 (quarterly) and state unemployment filings",
          "2024 Forms 1099-MISC/1099-NEC issued to vendors and contractors",
          "Year-end inventory count and valuation summary, if applicable",
          "Partnership agreement and any amendments during 2024",
          "2023 Form 1065 and Schedules K-1 for reference",
          "Copies of any notices received from IRS or state authorities during 2024",
          "List of estimated tax payments made by the partnership during 2024"
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "2. Partner Organizer — Individual K-1 Inputs"
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Each partner should complete the organizer section below to confirm their personal information and report any items that affect their individual returns. Please note: the K-1 amounts will be computed from the partnership books; the organizer is for confirming partner data and capturing items not on the entity books."
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Partner 1 — Information"
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Field", "Response"],
        "rows": [
          ["Full legal name", ""],
          ["Social Security Number / ITIN", ""],
          ["Date of birth", ""],
          ["Current mailing address", ""],
          ["Ownership percentage (per agreement)", ""],
          ["Guaranteed payments received in 2024 (amount)", ""],
          ["Cash contributions made during 2024", ""],
          ["Distributions received during 2024 (cash or property)", ""],
          ["Any self-rental or related-party transactions with the partnership", ""],
          ["Any 2024 purchase or sale of partnership interest (including transfers)", ""],
          ["Foreign bank account or foreign asset disclosures (FBAR/8938) applicable?", ""],
          ["Estimated tax payments made personally for 2024", ""]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Partner 2 — Information"
      },
      {
        "kind": "table",
        "columns": ["Field", "Response"],
        "rows": [
          ["Full legal name", ""],
          ["Social Security Number / ITIN", ""],
          ["Date of birth", ""],
          ["Current mailing address", ""],
          ["Ownership percentage (per agreement)", ""],
          ["Guaranteed payments received in 2024 (amount)", ""],
          ["Cash contributions made during 2024", ""],
          ["Distributions received during 2024 (cash or property)", ""],
          ["Any self-rental or related-party transactions with the partnership", ""],
          ["Any 2024 purchase or sale of partnership interest (including transfers)", ""],
          ["Foreign bank account or foreign asset disclosures (FBAR/8938) applicable?", ""],
          ["Estimated tax payments made personally for 2024", ""]
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "3. Additional Notes"
      },
      {
        "kind": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          "If the partnership made any noncash charitable contributions, provide a description and fair market value documentation.",
          "If the partnership owns rental real estate, provide a rent roll and expense detail for each property.",
          "If the partnership has international operations or foreign partners, additional forms may be required — notify us promptly.",
          "If any partner changed address or banking details, provide updated information on this organizer.",
          "Digital copies are acceptable; scans of originals should be legible. For Excel files, please avoid using formulas that link to external workbooks."
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Thank you for your timely attention. Please contact Lucia Mendes with any questions regarding this request. We look forward to completing your 2024 return efficiently and accurately."
      },
      {
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "Lucia Mendes, Senior Accountant — Tax\nStonebridge Relationship Team"
      }
    ]
  }
}
